SUMMARY:The Robotics Founder’s Guide: Find Your Ideal Customer with Data
LOCATION:ETH AI Center\, Andreasstrasse 5\, OAT X11\, Oerlikon\, Zurich
DESCRIPTION:A hands-on session for robotics and deep-tech teams on choosing
  a first market: comparing customer segments\, testing assumptions against
  market and sales data\, and using AI to spot buying signals. Networking d
 rinks follow.\n\nOrganiser: ETH AI Center with Vantastics\, Nebius and Lim
 bi\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/robotics
 -founders-guide-ideal-customer-zurich-2026/
